<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<!--
	Broadcast discovery (255.255.255.255 and subnet-directed broadcast) needs
	Apple's Multicast Networking entitlement. Uncomment the key below only when
	the signing profile also carries the capability, otherwise signing fails:

	    <key>com.apple.developer.networking.multicast</key>
	    <true/>

	Without it the app still pairs: PairingService falls back to unicast
	discovery, which sends the same JSON payload straight to candidate LAN
	addresses. Free-account sideloading (LiveContainer/SideStore/Sideloadly)
	does not grant this capability, so treat manual IP entry as the primary
	path on a free account. See ios-app/README.md.
	-->
</dict>
</plist>
